      "writtenOn": "2015-09-16T01:37:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the spec calls for a very specific sequence of accesses for the two operations. The MAINB access should not be in the flow, data buffer fill up is supposed to happen after the offset register is written, offset is not supposed to be written for erase operations. Maybe this makes no difference for this design, I am not sure.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 82,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 83,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "4b28136bc32cf3a5ac5a260f148150326fec11a2",
